    {
      "name": "04 Realtime SSE (manual)",
      "description": "Ejecutar manualmente en Postman (soporta Server-Sent Events). Excluir de newman: la conexión permanece abierta hasta 300 s. APIM Consumption no garantiza SSE de larga duración (docs/MTEC-26_REALTIME_SSE.md).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Stream notifications",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.variables.get('bearerToken')) {",
                  "  console.warn('bearerToken vacío: se omite ' + pm.info.requestName);",
                  "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Content-Type text/event-stream', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('text/event-stream'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Correlation-ID",
                "value": "postman-stream-notifications",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "text/event-stream",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/notifications/stream",
            "description": "Abre el stream SSE del usuario autenticado. Enviar un evento message.sent.v1 a la cola para ver la notificación en vivo. Opcional: header Last-Event-ID con un UUID para reanudar."
